  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As reported by Swithun Crowe on April 13th 2011:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I was having trouble with the demo objects - everything seemed to work,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "apart from being able to view the list of objects in the demo SmileyStuff",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "collection. Looking at the list with URL",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "/fedora/get/demo:SmileyStuff/demo:Collection/list",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "worked, but",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "/fedora/objects/demo:SmileyStuff/datastreams/LIST/content",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "didn't. It gave this error:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Error getting",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://itspc-cs2.st-andrews.ac.uk:443/fedora/get/demo:SmileyStuff/demo:Collection/list"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://itspc-cs2.st-andrews.ac.uk:443/fedora/get/demo:SmileyStuff/demo:Collection/list",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It is using a secure port, but the protocol is still http, with no s.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I traced this back to",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "fcrepo/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/storage/DefaultExternalContentManager.java,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "in method getFromWeb, where there is a colon where there shouldn't be one.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The protocol string returned by params.getProtocol doesn't include the :",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "after the protocol, so the comparison fails when it should succeed.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is a patch for it:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "— DefaultExternalContentManager.java.orig     2011-04-13 10:42:07.000000000 +0100",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "+++ DefaultExternalContentManager.java  2011-04-13 10:42:19.000000000 +0100",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "@@ -313,7 +313,7 @@",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "new Boolean(beHash.get(\"callSSL\"))",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ".booleanValue();",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "if (backendSSL) {",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "               if (params.getProtocol().equals(\"http:\")) {",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "+                if (params.getProtocol().equals(\"http\")) {",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "                     url = url.replaceFirst(\"http:\", \"https:\");",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "                 }",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "                 url =",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    }
   ],
